---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Get in touch with the KodaTools team. Suggest a new tool, report an issue, or send us feedback."
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">We'd love to hear from you.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>Have a suggestion for a new calculator or tool? Spotted a bug or an incorrect result? Want to share feedback? Reach out and we'll get back to you.</p>

      <h3>Suggest a Tool</h3>
      <p>We're always expanding our collection. If there's a calculator or tool you'd find useful, tell us what it should do and how you'd use it.</p>

      <h3>Report an Issue</h3>
      <p>If a result looks wrong, please include the tool name, the values you entered, and what you expected. That helps us fix it quickly.</p>

      <h3>Email</h3>
      <p>The fastest way to reach us is by email:</p>
      <div class="formula-box" style="text-align:center;">hello@kodatools.com</div>

      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">We aim to respond within a few business days. Please note we cannot provide financial, medical, or legal advice.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
